    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything i write feels like a cheap imitation of who i used to be. i can feel it, like a wall. i've reached the end of what i actually have to say. there's no point in even trying anymore if i'm just gonna spend the rest of my life watching myself decay and become a parody of a musician. it's actually painful to wake up and realize i'm just... done.",
